sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor P as Person (phone)
  participant S as Server (code)
  participant G as Gemma (JobRunner + ModelClient)
  participant W as Weather service
  participant D as SQLite

  P->>S: POST /api/cards "water the tomatoes"
  S->>G: listener job
  G-->>S: chores[] with label and chore_type
  S->>D: card, rule band, backstop check, rule quote
  S-->>P: card at once, "Gemma is thinking, rule odds"
  opt flag safetyGuard
    S->>G: safety job (an alert wins and ends the card)
  end
  S->>G: bookmaker job (rule band in the input)
  G->>S: tool call get_forecast(hours_ahead)
  S->>W: cached forecast
  W-->>S: hourly rows
  S-->>G: tool result inside untrusted delimiters
  G-->>S: band, reason, settle_in_hours, disagreement_reason if 2+ bands from rule
  S->>D: schema + checks, settle time clamped, backstop on final window, quote source gemma, decision row
  alt Gemma offline, invalid, no tool call or past 45 s
    S-->>P: labelled rule odds, Retry, betting allowed
  end
  P->>S: POST /api/bets (do nothing)
  S->>D: bet locked: band, odds, payouts, rule band, model and prompt version (undo for 5 min)

  Note over S,D: scheduler every 60 s marks the bet due at its settle time
  S->>W: recorded weather for the bet window (modelled recent weather)
  P->>S: after photo (x1.0) or one tap (x0.5)
  S->>D: answer saved first in settle_progress
  S->>G: judge job (answer, recorded weather, photos)
  alt Gemma offline, busy, late or invalid
    S->>D: status awaiting_gemma, retried every 2 min, the rule never settles
  else verdict
    G-->>S: verdict and reason (win, small, normal or harmful loss)
    S->>D: points, multiplier, savings, lucky_win from outcome labels, decision row
    S-->>P: PAID OUT receipt with Gemma's read
  end
  Note over S,D: no answer 24 h after settle time: judge decides from the weather record alone, win paid at x0.5
  S->>D: Score: calibration by band for Gemma and for the rule, rule-odds bets excluded from Gemma
